  "system": {
    "identifier": "lightning-release-shock-whip",
    "description": "<p>You create a whip of lightning, and lash it at a target creature in range. Make a ranged ninjutsu attack against a creature in range. On a hit, you deal 2d10 Lightning damage and they must make a Constitution saving throw being Grappled by you and are being pulled 10 feet on a failed save, or half damage on a successful save.</p>\n<p>Overcharge. A creature who fails their saving throw gains 1 rank of Shocked.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and increase the damage by 1d10 and the range by 10ft. If this jutsu is cast at C-Rank or higher, you can target one additional creature with this jutsu. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, a creature that fails their saving throw is now Restrained instead of Grappled.</p>",
